# Project context

NASA Space Apps 2026, Challenge 1: "Abandoned but not Forgotten: Storytelling
about NASA's Discarded Equipment on the Moon and Mars".
Stack: React + Vite + Tailwind + Three.js/R3F + framer-motion.
Two modes exist: Kids (default) and Adult, switched in `src/App.tsx`.

# HARD RULES

- Do NOT change or remove existing Kids/Adult pages, styling or behaviour.
  Add new things beside them. Adult Mode has no voice-over.
- Never invent coordinates, dates or facts. If unknown, set `"verified": false`,
  leave a TODO and a source hint. Only `"verified": true` objects may show on the map.
- Static app only, no backend. Every asset local. No hotlinked images, no CDN
  fonts, no live API calls in the demo path. Support `?offline=1`.
- Run `npm run lint` and `npm run build` after each phase and fix errors before continuing.
